# Reach a CLEAN strategic-map frame: load lastturn.sav then dismiss every
# entry message-scroll (the "Non 256 colour" warning + "Game Objectives" +
# any follow-ups) by spraying clicks down the scroll continue-button COLUMN.
#
# The scroll button is the black "OK" circle at the scroll bottom-right; X is
# ~constant (~417) but Y tracks the scroll height, so we click x=417 at a
# range of Y over several rounds (each round clears the topmost scroll and
# reveals the next).  Robust without per-scroll geometry; superseded later by
# the TAS {wait_until: scroll_active==0} segment-break (deferred).
#
# Run (turbo): nix develop -c python3 -u tools/frida_capture.py --skip-intro
#   --turbo --input-trace tools/traces/load_map_clean.jsonl --frame-capture
#   --frame-capture-warmup-secs 32 --frame-capture-max 4 --run-id strat-cleanN
#
# Coords GAME space (640x480); lParam=(y<<16)|x.
